<title>PHILIPPINES: Far East Bank sets 40 centavo cash div.</title>
<headline>Far East Bank sets 40 centavo cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Far East Bank and Trust Co Inc declared a 40 centavo cash dividend for shareholders as of March 31, the Philippine Stock Exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The ex-dividend date is set on March 18 and the dividend will be paid on April 8.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
